  "body": "<section class=\"outreach-title body-section\"><div class=\"section-child\"><h1 class=\"heading-31\">Outreach 2019-2020</h1></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/3a50b49d02b7ebd1-65d3d21e2d4396d274bf1ec0_Screen_Shot_2024-02-19_at_2.11.23_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 94vw, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/ac02accc56e10907-65d3d21e2d4396d274bf1ec0_Screen_Shot_2024-02-19_at_2.11.23_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/d60d66491c208757-65d3d21e2d4396d274bf1ec0_Screen_Shot_2024-02-19_at_2.11.23_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/b8cad0d405d948cf-65d3d21e2d4396d274bf1ec0_Screen_Shot_2024-02-19_at_2.11.23_PM-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/3a50b49d02b7ebd1-65d3d21e2d4396d274bf1ec0_Screen_Shot_2024-02-19_at_2.11.23_PM.png 1536w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">PHS Engineering Lab Fundraiser</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">2019</p><p>Highlander Robotics held an Engineering Lab Fundraiser for Piedmont High School, hosted by Piedmont Makers and raised $420,000 for the Mary G Ross Engineering Lab. 8033 team members demonstrated their robot and talked about the FIRST Robotics Competition to potential donors and the school board.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/469cb6d115cd3d3e-65c7ceaa2bfec259279a3118_Screen_Shot_2024-02-10_at_11.29.14_AM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 88vw, (max-width: 767px) 345.484375px, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/781f1550ab0ecd7e-65c7ceaa2bfec259279a3118_Screen_Shot_2024-02-10_at_11.29.14_AM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/6cbf473ba4efa8b2-65c7ceaa2bfec259279a3118_Screen_Shot_2024-02-10_at_11.29.14_AM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/469cb6d115cd3d3e-65c7ceaa2bfec259279a3118_Screen_Shot_2024-02-10_at_11.29.14_AM.png 1052w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">2019 Season Reflection</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">Ongoing</p><p>Ongoing since 2019:<br>2019-2022 We regularly write articles in our local papers, the Piedmont Post, and the Exedra, which is a local news website. Our team members continue to serve as mentors to local FTC and FLL teams.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/8727e138d7b16d2d-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 88vw, (max-width: 767px) 300px, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/979dd859ceca9356-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/c28d1bdd25a7370f-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/009b6622224b223c-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/d541bbe8c884564c-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/e6271ec846ecd059-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-2000.jpeg 2000w, /assets/b1ac4b7fe0998710-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515-p-2600.jpeg 2600w, /assets/8727e138d7b16d2d-65ab4ff70650b3f808185d17_IMG_0515.jpeg 3024w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">Open House</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">02/2020</p><p>Hosted by Piedmont Makers, the Founders of the Highlander Robotics talked about the FIRST Robotics Competition program to drum up interest in our community.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/4864a89dea318b3a-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 94vw, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/d59bfce537030243-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/79a02f12d893be49-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/fc24743fa1ad2544-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/6c9d4eab10d6c3d8-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/627ac83051d9e731-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-2000.jpeg 2000w, /assets/6425c6cb6ad71c4f-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-2600.jpeg 2600w, /assets/c77f0bc657358fdf-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438-p-3200.jpeg 3200w, /assets/4864a89dea318b3a-65ab4a97e3470a53f2432a81_IMG_1438.jpeg 4032w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">Field Trips</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">2019 Season</p><p>Highlander robotics toured Creator Burger, Abundant Robotics, and attended Spartan Series. These field trips help to inspire our team and encourage a new level of creativity.</p></div></div></section>"
